Haify shared knowledge base, public edition

Most of it is built from the Haify repository,
https://github.com/haify-project/haify, under the Apache License 2.0: the
documentation, the operations runbooks, the code graph, the strings mined
from the source and the command-line and REST API reference.

It also holds the DRBD 9 User's Guide by LINBIT, from
https://github.com/LINBIT/linbit-documentation (UG9, English), licensed under
the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 License,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/legalcode. Here the guide is
split into passages, embedded and has its entities extracted. That adaptation
is shared under the same license.
